**（d）build.sh 的门禁。** [ascendc/build.sh:178-192](https://github.com/gitcode.com/ascend-tribe/openPangu-2.0-Op/blob/c1d24e36d7fb94a98607a02b0edc88c47b64d850/training/ascendc/build.sh#L178-L192) `set_ut_mode` 把 `-u --ophost` 翻译成 `OP_HOST_UT=TRUE`；[第 231-254 行](https://github.com/gitcode.com/ascend-tribe/openPangu-2.0-Op/blob/c1d24e36d7fb94a98607a02b0edc88c47b64d850/training/ascendc/build.sh#L231-L254) `check_ophost_test_exists` 强制要求 `-n` 指定的每个算子必须有 `tests/ut/op_host` 目录，否则 `exit 1`；[第 361-363 行](https://github.com/gitcode.com/ascend-tribe/openPangu-2.0-Op/blob/c1d24e36d7fb94a98607a02b0edc88c47b64d850/training/ascendc/build.sh#L361-L363) 把 `-n` 透传为 `-DASCEND_OP_NAME`。

